From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Philipp Hancke <philipp.hancke@googlemail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 17:02:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04/21] sctp: reduce the MTU to 1189 bytes

see https://issues.webrtc.org/issues/42222640
This is the size of the SCTP packet including the 12 byte common
header, leaving 1160 bytes of user data per DATA chunk after the
16 byte chunk header and 4-byte padding.

See also
  https://github.com/pion/sctp/pull/476
and the funny tailscale story
